config AW8697_HAPTIC
    tristate "Haptic driver for awinic aw8697 series"
    depends on I2C
    help
      This option enables support for aw8697 series Haptic Driver.

config AW8697_HAPTIC_CHEN_MOD
    tristate "Haptic driver for awinic aw8697 series with chen mod"
    depends on I2C
    
    help
      This option enables support for aw8697 series Haptic Driver with Chen Mod.
